<main><section class="hero"><div class="inner"><p class="eyebrow">Forever Young Beauty by Layla · Titchfield Common</p><h1>Massage in Fareham</h1><p class="lead">Take time for yourself with a personalised massage at Forever Young Beauty by Layla, in a calm, private treatment room at Abshot Country Club.</p><a class="button" href={booking}>View prices &amp; availability</a></div></section>
<div class="content"><section><h2>Massage tailored to you</h2><p>Whether you're looking for general wellbeing or focused attention for areas of tension, Layla can discuss your preferences and help you choose a suitable massage treatment.</p></section>
<section><h2>Swedish and aromatherapy massage</h2><p>Swedish massage uses flowing techniques tailored to your preferences. Ask Layla about the available aromatherapy options and any sensitivities before your appointment.</p></section>
<section><h2>Deep tissue massage</h2><p>For clients who prefer firmer pressure and more focused work on areas of muscular tension, ask about deep tissue massage and the level of pressure that suits you.</p></section>
<section><h2>Sports massage</h2><p>Sports massage uses focused hands-on techniques for people experiencing muscular tightness from exercise, physical activity or everyday demands. Whether you are active regularly or simply prefer a more targeted massage, ask Layla about the options available and whether they suit you.</p></section>
<section><h2>Massage for muscular aches and tension</h2><p>Massage may help ease everyday muscular tension, stiffness and discomfort, while supporting physical wellbeing. Let Layla know which areas are troubling you so she can discuss a suitable approach. Persistent, severe or unexplained pain should be assessed by a healthcare professional rather than relying on massage alone.</p></section>
<section><h2>Pregnancy massage</h2><p>Pregnancy massage is adapted for comfort and individual circumstances. Let Layla know your stage of pregnancy and any health concerns when enquiring so suitability can be discussed.</p></section>
<section><h2>Lymphatic drainage massage</h2><p>Layla also lists lymphatic drainage massage among her services. Contact the salon for details of the approach offered and whether it suits your needs.</p></section>
<section><h2>Choose your appointment</h2><p>Full-body massage and shorter back, neck and shoulder options may be available. Check the current treatment menu for exact options, durations and prices.</p></section>

<section class="contact"><h2>Book your appointment</h2><p>Beauty at Abshot, Abshot Country Club, Little Abshot Road, Titchfield Common, Fareham, Hampshire PO14 4LN. Welcoming clients from Fareham, Titchfield, Locks Heath, Whiteley and Park Gate.</p><a class="button" href={booking}>View treatment prices &amp; availability</a></section>
